R0       EQU   0                                                        00067000
R1       EQU   1                                                        00067100
R2       EQU   2                                                        00067200
R3       EQU   3                                                        00067300
R4       EQU   4                                                        00067400
R5       EQU   5                       Counter number of USER records   00067500
R6       EQU   6                       Address of USER entry in table   00067600
R7       EQU   7                                                        00067700
R8       EQU   8                       Address of IKJPARS PDL           00067800
R9       EQU   9                                                        00067900
R10      EQU   10                                                       00068000
